// AI frontend embedded pages (compile-time packed; source of truth = ui\ folder).
// 300 = index.html (top-level document), 301 = app.css, 302 = app.js.
// Loaded via FindResourceW(RT_RCDATA) in ai_web.cpp - keep the IDs in sync there.
// Note: rc strings process backslash escapes (\a = bell!), so double them.
300 RCDATA "ui\\index.html"
301 RCDATA "ui\\app.css"
302 RCDATA "ui\\app.js"
